{
    "word": "freshet",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                "word": "freshet",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8b733aa6-1f42-4765-ab9c-ee5a81e6b56f",
                        "entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "freshets"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3821415e-3065-3015-b5f7-e5a58758d1b6",
                        "entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A flood resulting from heavy rain or a spring thaw."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8d6398a-b10a-4289-abc2-5dc7f7d48f5f",
                                "sense_id": "3821415e-3065-3015-b5f7-e5a58758d1b6",
                                "text": "Log after log is hauled to the bank of the river, and in a short time their first raft is made on the shore and loaded with cordwood. When the next freshet sets it afloat, it is secured by long grapevines or cables until, the proper time being arrived, the husband and sons embark on it and float down the mighty stream."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e0e3878-60e0-440c-8d2a-ff61ca476c23",
                                "sense_id": "3821415e-3065-3015-b5f7-e5a58758d1b6",
                                "text": "“My father had ideas about conservation long before the United States took it up.[…]You preserve water in times of flood and freshet to be used for power or for irrigation throughout the year. …”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dceedbc-9b2b-33a5-8130-65658bbf09a2",
                        "entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small stream, especially one flowing into the sea."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "poetic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b7ab099-1682-49a0-b5d1-22cfbf0a403d",
                                "sense_id": "3dceedbc-9b2b-33a5-8130-65658bbf09a2",
                                "text": "“His arrival upon any scene was never in the smallest degree uproarious, and still less was it in the least mild or serene; yet he came into a settled circle like a freshet of tumbling water into a still pool!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58258357-2f25-4d00-bab5-34060ccb7959",
                                "sense_id": "3dceedbc-9b2b-33a5-8130-65658bbf09a2",
                                "text": "Between the curbs and the snow banks a freshet of clear blue water rises. Within me a freshet that chokes the narrow gorge of my veins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c81eadbe-1083-4909-991d-66c344ef359d",
                                "sense_id": "3dceedbc-9b2b-33a5-8130-65658bbf09a2",
                                "text": "We may find a dozen big catfish lying in the belly of the net, or a couple of walleyed pike, or some other kind of fresh-water fish. A freshet brought them down, and they were making their way back up the river, and they hit the net."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05ddace0-376c-4aea-94f6-17304ee38efb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A flood resulting from heavy rain or a spring thaw",
                        "target_lang_word": "podtopienie",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "podtopienie",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0dd14f6-0051-3660-b53a-1f5c93d24336",
                                        "entry_id": "d2711ca6-1e18-3d71-8234-5978375ab3eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "częściowe zalanie obszaru lub zabudowań"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d400dd-021c-485e-8b64-bf5daf99f808",
                                                "sense_id": "c0dd14f6-0051-3660-b53a-1f5c93d24336",
                                                "text": "Gospodarstwa w dolinie uległy podtopieniom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30b10e33-fac7-4e7c-8b35-708e79ab421a",
                                                "sense_id": "c0dd14f6-0051-3660-b53a-1f5c93d24336",
                                                "text": "Przeprowadzono także badania otoczenia małych zbiorników wodnych, obszarów podmokłych wskutek podtopień cieków i jezior pod kątem występowania schistosomatozy"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7bcb04a-2144-42fa-90c8-7ad14a35a7ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A flood resulting from heavy rain or a spring thaw",
                        "target_lang_word": "па́водок",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "па́водок",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "837ac0ec-010b-3fae-afc9-6bf49d449de5",
                                        "entry_id": "197436cd-cc05-321a-846d-95f8d202dac6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "сравнительно кратковременное непериодическое поднятие уровня воды в реке в результате таяния снегов или льдов либо обильных ливней"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a84dc67b-4db3-4bd9-8ebf-ff61ef9fa63d",
                                                "sense_id": "837ac0ec-010b-3fae-afc9-6bf49d449de5",
                                                "text": "В паводок воды, не вмещаясь в русле такой реки, затопляют громадные площади, губят посевы, жилища, домашних животных."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7c0a739-4db2-4cd3-8924-602173df1bde",
                                                "sense_id": "837ac0ec-010b-3fae-afc9-6bf49d449de5",
                                                "text": "Резкий подъем воды, паводок, вызванный ливневыми дождями или бурным таянием снегов где-то в верховьях, ― вот ручей уже не ручей, а ревущий, сметающий на своем пути мутный от ила, песка и почвы поток."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98469a14-f76f-4e4a-9f97-e2d4f546d3bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
                        "source_sense_description": "A flood resulting from heavy rain or a spring thaw",
                        "target_lang_word": "полово́дье",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "полово́дье",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dca4066a-ffea-3cd2-b4a8-cb80d597ca7f",
                                        "entry_id": "4f728f3a-52b0-36b4-bb4d-b6a817cf1e41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "повторяющееся в один и тот же сезон года относительно длительное и значительное увеличение водности реки"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f84c807d-a2ff-411e-aabc-05cb59d24b1c",
                                                "sense_id": "dca4066a-ffea-3cd2-b4a8-cb80d597ca7f",
                                                "text": "Перри боялся весеннего половодья, которое грозило разрушить начатые и беспомощные сооружения."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5928b424-987c-39d3-b204-575fd2962a9c",
                                        "entry_id": "4f728f3a-52b0-36b4-bb4d-b6a817cf1e41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен. поэт. высшая степень или избыток чего-либо"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "361567b8-ec67-469c-9357-5b0fb0181f76",
                                                "sense_id": "5928b424-987c-39d3-b204-575fd2962a9c",
                                                "text": "Где ре́вность и бессонница? Где половодье чувств? Где не отправленные письма с расплывшимися чернилами?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8787c27-e99c-4402-a24a-b61fd1b46bcf",
                        "source_entry_id": "a72c3f83-8cfa-3b75-948a-6634cc724e6b",
